── A PROJECTION ISN'T A VALUE ── E0426_a_projection_isn_t_a_value.lt:7:14  [E0426]

A projection can only be called: its call is a place, so it has no function
type:

  7 │   let cell = at
    │              ^^

A projection's call is a place, not a value, so it can only be called. Call it
where you use it.
